# Horizon Tutors Hub - Setup

## Files to put in GitHub
bot.py, texts.py, requirements.txt, .gitignore, SETUP.md
Never commit your bot token or the Google JSON key. The .gitignore blocks *.json files.

## Environment variables (Render > Environment)
| Name | What it is |
|---|---|
| TELEGRAM_TOKEN | Token from @BotFather (required) |
| ADMIN_CHAT_ID | Chat that receives approval requests (your user ID, or a group ID) |
| ADMIN_IDS | Comma-separated Telegram user IDs allowed to press admin buttons. Required if ADMIN_CHAT_ID is a group |
| JOB_CHANNEL_ID | Public job channel, e.g. -100123456789. The bot must be a channel admin that can post and edit |
| GOOGLE_JSON | The service-account JSON key pasted as one line |
| SHEET_NAME | Sheet name (default: Horizon Tutors Hub) |
| REQUIRE_CLIENT_ID | true/false. Default false: you call parents to verify instead of asking for an ID |
| TRIAL_THRESHOLD | Budget (ETB) above which the longer trial applies (default 4000) |
| MIN_BUDGET | Smallest budget accepted (default 300) |
| CONVERSATION_TIMEOUT | Seconds before an abandoned form resets (default 1800) |

Find your user ID by messaging @userinfobot.

## Google Sheet
1. Share the sheet with the service account email (Editor). Share it with nobody else.
2. The bot creates the tabs Tutors, Client_Requests, Applications and Settings itself.
3. If a tab from an older version has different columns, the bot renames it to <name>_old_<date> and creates a fresh one. Your old data is kept.

## Render
- Build command: pip install -r requirements.txt
- Start command: python bot.py
- A free Web Service sleeps after about 15 minutes without web traffic, and the bot goes silent. Either use a paid instance or Background Worker, or point a free pinger (e.g. UptimeRobot) at your Render URL every 5 minutes.
- Restarts clear half-finished forms. Finished registrations are safe in the sheet.

## Admin commands
- /filled R012 - marks the job Filled and edits the channel post
- /stats - counts of tutors, jobs and applications

## Before launch
- Have a native speaker check the Amharic and Afaan Oromoo text in texts.py.
- Test the full flow with a second Telegram account: tutor register > approve > client request > approve > apply > send profile > /filled.
- Read Ethiopia's personal data protection proclamation and keep ID photos limited to you.
